### Traffic totals for the last 30 calendar days
GET http://localhost:5000/_analytics/api/summary?range=30d&tz=UTC
Accept: application/json

### Countries represented in GitHub traffic
GET http://localhost:5000/_analytics/api/breakdown?range=30d&tz=UTC&dimension=country&filter=source%3D%3DGitHub&includeSessionMetrics=false
Accept: application/json
